# 13 — Database Schema (DBML)

> **⚠️ SUPERSEDED:** This DBML file was the original design. The actual source of truth is now the Drizzle ORM schema at `packages/db/src/schema/`.
>
> Kept for reference only. Do NOT treat this file as authoritative.
> If discrepancies exist, the Drizzle schema wins.

## Actual Table Inventory (Verified from Drizzle Schema)

### users.ts
- `users` — Core accounts (email, username, password_hash, is_active, soft-delete)
- `userPreferences` — Theme, language, timezone, JSON preferences
- `userSettings` — Email/push/marketing notification toggles

### auth.ts
- `roles` — RBAC roles (name, level, isSystem)
- `userRoles` — User↔Role join table
- `rolePermissions` — Role↔Permission mappings
- `permissionsCatalog` — Permission definitions (action, resource, category)
- `permissionGroups` — Permission grouping

### billing.ts
- `plans` — Subscription tiers (slug, prices in cents, coin_grant, polar_product_id)
- `planLimits` — Per-plan resource limits
- `planFeatures` — Plan feature toggles
- `planCoinRules` — Plan-specific coin rules
- `subscriptions` — User subscriptions (period tracking, cancellation, Stripe ID)
- `payments` — Payment records (amount_cents, provider, status)
- `invoices` — Invoice records
- `coinTransactions` — INSERT-only ledger (purchase/bonus/spend/refund/admin_adjust/expiration)
- `userCoinWallets` — Cached coin balance (derived from ledger)
- `coinPacks` — Purchasable coin packages
- `toolCoinCosts` — Per-tool coin pricing
- `loginRewardClaims` — Daily login reward tracking
- `userDailyRewardCaps` — Daily reward limits
- `userStreaks` — Login streak tracking
- `processedWebhooks` — Webhook idempotency (provider event IDs)
- `usageCoinFallbacks` — Coin fallback when plan limit exceeded

### tools.ts
- `toolCategories` — Tool category hierarchy
- `tools` — Tool metadata (slug, runtime, group, search via `to_tsvector`)
- `toolLimits` — Per-user-type tool limits
- `toolVersions` — Tool version history
- `usageCounters` — Usage tracking (user, resource_key, period_start, count)
- `toolExecutions` — Execution log (tool, user, status, duration)
- `apiKeys` — B2B API keys (hashed, plan-linked)
- `anonymousUsage` — Anonymous user tracking (IP hash, fingerprint)
- `apiRateLimits` — API rate limit config
- `dailyProTrials` — Pro tool trial tracking
- `toolClassPolicy` — Tool class access policies
- `webhookEndpoints` — Customer webhook endpoints

### misc.ts
- `fileUploads` — Uploaded file tracking (R2 paths)
- `asyncJobs` — Background job tracking (externalJobId, status, progress)
- `notifications` — User notifications
- `favorites` — User favorited tools
- `featureFlags` — Feature flag system (toggle/kill_switch/experiment/rollout)
- `emailProviderConfig` — Email provider settings (Resend/SMTP)
- `emailTemplates` — Email templates
- `emailLogs` — Email send log
- `adminSettings` — Admin key-value settings
- `userOnboarding` — Onboarding step tracking
- `emailUsageTracking` — Email provider usage tracking

### config.ts
- `streakTiers` — Streak reward tiers
- `referralConfig` — Referral program config
- `rateLimitConfig` — Rate limit rules
- `notificationTemplates` — Notification templates

### audit.ts
- `auditLogs` — Audit trail (INSERT-only)
- `webhookLogs` — Webhook receive log
